  "raw_html": "<div class=\"content-area\" id=\"primary\">\n<main class=\"site-main\" id=\"main\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-b39c368c\">\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">RPSC 2nd Grade Teacher Answer Key 2026</h1>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-08-06T16:49:58+05:30\">August 6, 2026</time></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">4:49 pm</span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><a href=\"https://rpsc.rajasthan.gov.in/news\">Rajasthan Public Service Commission (RPSC)</a>,</span></strong> has released the <strong>Answer Key</strong> on its <strong>official website</strong> for the recruitment of <strong>2nd Grade Teacher Posts. </strong>The <strong>exam</strong> was conducted on <strong>12 \u2013 18 July 2026.</strong> The\u00a0<strong>RPSC</strong> application process\u00a0started on\u00a0<strong>19 August 2025,</strong> and candidates were able to submit their Application until\u00a0<strong>17 September 2025.</strong> Candidates can check their\u00a0<strong>Answer Key</strong>\u00a0using their\u00a0<strong>Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>\u00a0by logging into the\u00a0<strong>portal.\u00a0The\u00a0direct link</strong>\u00a0is provided below.\u00a0<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>(Advt.No: 07/Exam/Sr. Teach. (Sec. Edu.)/RPSC/EP-I/2025-26)</strong></span></span></p>\n</p>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><style>\n        .social-buttons {\n            display: flex;\n            gap: 10px;\n        }